1
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,851
(Dreams.)

2
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,811
(Friendship.)

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,120
(Love.)

4
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,824
(Money.)

5
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,126
(Family.)

6
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,542
(Youth.)

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,360
(These were all things
I once longed for.)

8
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:34,440
(Not until the cycle of rebirth
kept restarting,)

9
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,880
(and life and death
became familiar to me,)

10
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:40,000
(did I finally see the ugly faces)

11
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,040
(beneath all your masks.)

12
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,240
(Since the cycle of rebirth)

13
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,800
(is destined to be never-ending,)

14
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:46,520
(I promise you)

15
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,520
(I will)

16
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,760
(play this game with you all,)

17
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,000
(until we)

18
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,600
(suffer together,)

19
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,800
(with no way back.)

20
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,600
=Born Again=

21
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,360
Today, the influencer Gu Xiaotang,

22
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:02,600
(Haishan City, M Country)
and Lu Qingyuan, heir of Lu Group,

23
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 1=
hold a grand wedding.

24
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:06,440
It is said
that in order to marry Gu Xiaotang,

25
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:08,600
Lu Qingyuan will pay
a sky-high termination fee for her

26
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,840
to help her leave her agency.

27
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,680
(Gu Xiaotang, Lu Qingyuan)
Didn't expect in this materialistic age,

28
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,760
someone would spend a fortune for love.

29
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:18,200
(Honey, today is our wedding day.)

30
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:21,360
(I'm so looking forward to seeing you
in your wedding dress.)

31
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:23,120
(I bought a lot of)

32
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,720
(your favorite roses.)

33
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,040
(I'll bring them all to you.)

34
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:32,120
(Honey, I've also prepared
a surprise for you.)

35
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:33,783
(See you soon.)

36
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,240
Happy wedding!

37
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,283
(Director
of Gu Xiaotang's Former Agency)

38
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:55,040
Thank you.

39
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:07,908
Director...

40
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,639
You wretch!

41
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:14,400
Why aren't you wearing
the sponsored wedding dress?

42
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,600
You had me
get the waist reduction surgery.

43
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,240
The sutures are there.

44
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,320
How can I wear it?

45
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,800
If you don't wear it,

46
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,440
I have to pay compensation.

47
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:24,040
If you don't give me the money,

48
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,400
I'll go ask your husband.

49
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,729
Don't.

50
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,176
I'll wear it.

51
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,080
Director Li, it's a bit too tight.

52
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,520
Just tighten it.

53
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,280
Seriously?

54
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,577
Put some strength into it.

55
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:51,908
Hold it there.

56
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,544
This expression is great.

57
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,920
The statement will be,

58
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:58,040
"Gu Xiaotang was moved to tears

59
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,176
in a custom wedding dress."

60
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,760
(It's okay.)

61
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,520
(Everything will be fine.)

62
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,550
Xiaotang.

63
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,312
Xiaotang.

64
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,360
It's not what you think.

65
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,680
Xiaotang.

66
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,840
- Don't misunderstand.
- Why?

67
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,960
Xiaotang, I...

68
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,440
She is my best friend.

69
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:19,120
Xiaotang, let me explain.

70
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,213
- Let go of me!
- Xiaotang, let me explain.

71
00:04:21,213 --> 00:04:22,920
- Xiaotang, don't misunderstand.
- Let go!

72
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:25,958
Lu Qingyuan,

73
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,200
I thought that after we got married,

74
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,840
I'd quit my job

75
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,880
to take care of you and Mom.

76
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,920
Why are you doing this?

77
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:37,000
Why are you doing this to me?

78
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:40,013
Why?

79
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,054
Are you done?

80
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:49,200
I bought you.

81
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,600
Quit your job, honey?

82
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,480
I bought you to earn money for me.

83
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,480
If you don't earn money,

84
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,120
my money will be wasted.

85
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,360
You know that?

86
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,600
To wear a custom wedding dress,

87
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,320
you even removed your own ribs?

88
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:43,122
Look how desperately
you claw your way up,

89
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:44,920
it's truly disgusting.

90
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,880
Gu Xiaotang, don't forget.

91
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,760
If you skip the wedding,

92
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:02,920
I won't spend money
to terminate your contract.

93
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:05,651
Honey,

94
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,987
see you at the wedding.

95
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,920
Let's use the warmest applause

96
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,680
to welcome the most beautiful bride,

97
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,480
Gu Xiaotang!

98
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,535
Everyone,

99
00:06:33,535 --> 00:06:35,400
Xiaotang is wearing our wedding dress.

100
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,320
- Looks great, right?
- Why filming her face?

101
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:39,080
Focus on the wedding dress. I'll do it.

102
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,360
This girl is so lucky

103
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,720
to marry into your family.

104
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,720
(Lu Qingyuan's Mother)

105
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:44,880
With a quickie wedding,

106
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,120
she can get into high society.

107
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:48,160
Gu Xiaotang is truly living the dream.

108
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:51,360
Exactly. She has a best friend
and a good husband.

109
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,600
I really envy her.

110
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:57,360
Before the wedding ceremony begins,

111
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:59,240
the bride, Miss Gu Xiaotang,

112
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,400
told me

113
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,800
she wrote a letter

114
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:04,360
for the two most important people
in her life.

115
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,200
Why isn't she reading the letter?

116
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:15,484
Yeah.

117
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:16,723
Read it out loud!

118
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,171
Honey.

119
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,480
Don't push it.

120
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,301
Many distinguished guests are here.

121
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,295
Xiaotang,

122
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:33,610
don't be nervous.

123
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,083
Read it.

124
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,520
Thank you, my husband,

125
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:49,919
Lu Qingyuan.

126
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:53,080
In the darkest time of my life,
thank you for being

127
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,720
a beam of light...

128
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,480
(A beam of light illuminating me.)

129
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,365
(I hope)

130
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:04,480
(we can have a baby soon)

131
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,356
(and start)

132
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,520
(a happy family.)

133
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,040
Thank you, Xia Na,

134
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,880
my best friend,

135
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:19,080
for being with me for ten years.

136
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,560
(You will always be)

137
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,520
(my most trustworthy support.)

138
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,192
(We)

139
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,960
will be best friends for life.

140
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:30,960
I'm so envious.

141
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,920
- Their friendship is wonderful.
- Indeed.

142
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:35,720
Gu Xiaotang is so lucky.

143
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,904
Xiaotang.

144
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:41,753
What's wrong?

145
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,800
Is it hypoglycemia again?

146
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,640
Since you can't hold on,

147
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,720
then don't force yourself.

148
00:08:58,760 --> 00:08:59,772
Xiaotang!

149
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,658
Xiaotang!

150
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,240
Oh no!

151
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:08,400
- Look at her neck!
- Her neck!

152
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,176
Is it serious?

153
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,480
Xiaotang.

154
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,800
Ambulance! Call an ambulance!

155
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,800
Stay back, everyone!

156
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,920
- Film it!
- Call an ambulance!

157
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:25,080
(So the happiness I bet everything on)

158
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,240
(turned out to be just a joke.)

159
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:31,279
(Fine.)

160
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,560
(Countdown to Death)
Let all of this,

161
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:36,400
along with my ridiculous life,

162
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:39,760
be completely shattered at this moment.

163
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:42,715
(Countdown to Death)

164
00:09:45,878 --> 00:09:52,034
(Two Hours Before the Wedding)

165
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,511
Is it a dream?

166
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:21,863
No.

167
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,221
Happy wedding!

168
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,320
Xiaotang, the wedding dress...

169
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,320
(Pain is so wonderful.)

170
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:38,360
(It can make me deeply remember
the evil deeds of each of you.)

171
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,200
(This time,)

172
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,400
(I will return all of them)

173
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,280
(to you bit by bit.)

174
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,374
(Welcome back,)

175
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,480
(Gu Xiaotang.)

176
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,120
Don't move.

177
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,960
This pose is perfect.

178
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,619
- Xiaotang, what are you doing?
- I said don't move.

179
00:12:03,961 --> 00:12:05,339
- Give me the camera.
- Xiaotang!

180
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,960
What are we filming, you say?

181
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:11,920
Isn't that the groom?

182
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,782
Gu Xiaotang, are you nuts?

183
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:15,129
Lu Qingyuan.

184
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:17,080
Tell me,

185
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:19,560
if photos of you
and my best friend get out,

186
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,880
how many days will the Lu Group's

187
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:22,880
stock price plummet?

188
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:23,946
You're crazy.

189
00:12:24,400 --> 00:12:25,442
And you,

190
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,840
can you even keep

191
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,942
your few endorsements?

192
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:36,280
Give me the termination fee now.

193
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,182
Otherwise,

194
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:40,120
this might be leaked.

195
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,880
No way.

196
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:43,045
What?

197
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,800
With so many people here,

198
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,219
do you want to snatch it?

199
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,800
Fine. I'll transfer it
to you right away.

200
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,640
Are you happy now?

201
00:12:59,504 --> 00:13:00,904
Not really.

202
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,320
You like to act, don't you?

203
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,120
Then join me for another act.

204
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,440
But this time,

205
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:07,960
I'll be the lead.

206
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:13,640
The wedding is about to start.

207
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:15,920
- The bride is coming!
- The bride is coming!

208
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:19,480
What's going on?

209
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,920
Why is she coming in like this?

210
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,480
What is she doing?

211
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:24,720
Is she the bride?

212
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:27,120
(Since heaven has given me
another chance,)

213
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:30,200
(I'll play with you properly.)

214
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,433
Move!

215
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:46,680
Miss Gu, you said you'd read a letter
before cutting the cake.

216
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,518
Pass.

217
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:55,640
Cut the cake now.

218
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,160
Honey,

219
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:00,839
Xia Na.

220
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,496
Come on.

221
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,240
Xia Na,

222
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:19,080
don't you love cakes the most?

223
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,360
Next time, don't sneak a bite.

224
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,800
Eat it openly.

225
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:31,897
I can do it myself, honey.

226
00:14:34,013 --> 00:14:36,560
Honey, didn't we agree?

227
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:37,560
This time,

228
00:14:37,903 --> 00:14:39,111
I'm the lead.

229
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,280
Gu Xiaotang, are you crazy?

230
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:50,194
Don't touch me!

231
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,280
- Get her!
- Son,

232
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:54,341
are you okay?

233
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,645
- Don't film!
- Don't film!

234
00:14:55,645 --> 00:14:56,745
Go away!

235
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,477
- What's there to film?
- Go away!

236
00:15:00,849 --> 00:15:04,120
(Countdown to Death)

237
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,520
- All of you, go away!
- Son!

238
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,183
What's going on?

239
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,160
How did I...

240
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:16,920
How did I get an allergic reaction?

241
00:15:20,076 --> 00:15:21,102
The cake.

242
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:22,673
Peanut?

243
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:25,320
How can there be peanuts in the cake?

244
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,680
Look, everyone.

245
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,080
What's wrong with the bride?

246
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:35,509
Gu Xiaotang.

247
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:40,179
Gu Xiaotang.

248
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,360
Stay put in the next loop.

249
00:15:44,828 --> 00:15:46,040
I'll come to you.

250
00:16:20,183 --> 00:16:23,539
♪The face deep in the heart♪

251
00:16:23,731 --> 00:16:26,193
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

252
00:16:27,568 --> 00:16:31,268
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

253
00:16:31,479 --> 00:16:33,919
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

254
00:16:34,066 --> 00:16:36,438
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

255
00:16:36,588 --> 00:16:39,345
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

256
00:16:39,345 --> 00:16:41,666
♪Even for just a second♪

257
00:16:43,011 --> 00:16:46,474
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

258
00:16:46,602 --> 00:16:48,451
♪And sunlight reverses♪

259
00:16:48,451 --> 00:16:51,921
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

260
00:16:52,277 --> 00:16:54,351
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

261
00:16:54,853 --> 00:16:58,262
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

262
00:16:58,519 --> 00:17:03,731
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

263
00:17:04,985 --> 00:17:07,550
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

264
00:17:07,592 --> 00:17:11,045
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

265
00:17:11,622 --> 00:17:14,585
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

266
00:17:15,330 --> 00:17:17,938
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

267
00:17:17,938 --> 00:17:21,561
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

268
00:17:22,031 --> 00:17:26,087
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
